                                                                                
**********************************************************************          
*                                                                    *          
* PROGRAM:    W56067                                                 *          
*                                                                    *          
* SKRIVET AV: SKJELBRED                                              *          
*                                                                    *          
* DATUM:      970731                                                 *          
*                                                                    *          
* FUNKTION:   DETTA PROGRAM SKAPAR LIFO-LISTORNA UA2509 UA2507       *          
*             (FYRA LISTOR) W56067-001, -041, -042, -043             *          
*             LIFO IN TRANSIT + TOTALLISTA                           *          
*                                                                    *          
* INDATA:     W560.W56061(+0) ÅRSPRISREGISTER FÖREG. ÅRSSKIFTE.      *          
*                (OBS OBS: W560.W56061(-1) VID OMKÖRNING)            *          
*             W560.W65065(+0) PÅGÅENDE INLEVERANSER WDL6 MEN         *          
*             RENSAR BORT BYTES-OBJEKT FRÅN FILEN VID SORTEN         *          
*                                                                    *          
* UTDATA:     LISTOR                                                 *          
*                                                                    *          
**********************************************************************          
                                                                                
* INFIL W56061(+0) ÅRSFIL MED ALLA ARTIKLARNAS PRISER                           
                                                                                
FILE W56067D1                                                                   
%W56061  'IN61-'                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
* INFIL W56065(+0) SPECIAL FIL FRÅN WDL6 PER DC                                 
                                                                                
FILE W56067D2                                                                   
%W56065  'IN65-'                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
* TEMPORÄR PRISFIL SORTERAD PÅ ARTIKELNR                                        
                                                                                
FILE TPFIL1 FB(210 0)                                                           
%W56061   'T61-'                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
* TEMPORÄR INLEVERANSFIL PER DC SORTERAD PÅ ARTIKELNR                           
                                                                                
FILE TPFIL2 FB(210 0)                                                           
%W56065   'T65-'                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
* RAPPORT U2509 DC 41  (W56067-041)                                             
                                                                                
FILE W56067D3 PRINTER VB (217 0)                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
* RAPPORT U2509 DC 43  (W56067-043)                                             
                                                                                
FILE W56067D5 PRINTER VB (217 0)                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
* RAPPORT U2507 LISTA2 (W56067-001)                                             
                                                                                
FILE W56067D6 PRINTER VB (217 0)                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
* UTFIL, ALLA OVANSTÅENDE LISTORS INFO PÅ FIL                                   
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
* ARBETS-AREOR                                                  *               
                                                                                
W-IDDC            W   2  A                                                      
W-IDFAKT          W   7  N     MASK 'ZZZZZZ9'.                                  
W-KVAKS           W   7  N     MASK 'ZZZZZZ9'.                                  
W-DAFAKT          W   8  N     MASK 'ZZZZZZZ9'.                                 
W-IDARTNR         W   9  N     MASK 'ZZZZZZZZ9'.                                
W-PRARTNTO        W   9  N  2  MASK 'ZZZZZZ9.99'                                
W-PRARTBTO        W   9  N  2  MASK 'ZZZZZZ9.99'                                
W-DAFAKT2         W   8  A                                                      
 W-DAFAKT-YYYY  W-DAFAKT2    4  A                                               
 W-DAFAKT-MM    W-DAFAKT2 +4 2  A                                               
 W-DAFAKT-DD    W-DAFAKT2 +6 2  A                                               
W-UT-FIX          W  10  A                                                      
W-UT-FIX-1 W-UT-FIX    2  A                                                     
W-UT-FIX-2 W-UT-FIX +2 1  A                                                     
W-UT-FIX-3 W-UT-FIX +3 2  A                                                     
W-UT-FIX-4 W-UT-FIX +5 1  A                                                     
W-UT-FIX-5 W-UT-FIX +6 4  A                                                     
W-EXTENSION1      W   9  N  2      MASK 'ZZZZZZ9.99'                            
W-EXTENSION2      W   9  N  2      MASK 'ZZZZZZ9.99'                            
W-COST            W   9  N  2      MASK 'ZZZZZZ9.99'                            
W-END-COST        W   9  N  2      MASK 'ZZZZZZ9.99'                            
W-SUM-EXTENS1     W   9  N  2      MASK 'ZZZZZZ9.99'                            
W-SUM-EXTENS2     W   9  N  2      MASK 'ZZZZZZ9.99'                            
W-SUM-EXTENS3     W   9  N  2      MASK 'ZZZZZZ9.99'                            
W-SUM-EXTENS4     W   9  N  2      MASK 'ZZZZZZ9.99'                            
W-SUM-EXTENS5     W   9  N  2      MASK 'ZZZZZZ9.99'                            
W-SUM-EXTENS6     W   9  N  2      MASK 'ZZZZZZ9.99'                            
W-SEM             W   6  A         VALUE ';'                                    
FIRST-LINE1       S   1  A         VALUE 'J'                                    
FIRST-LINE2       S   1  A         VALUE 'J'                                    
FIRST-LINE3       S   1  A         VALUE 'J'                                    
                                                                                
BYT03-OBJEKT      W   1  A         VALUE 'N'                                    
                                                                                
%WWDIST35   'T65-' WORK ''                                                      
*    --- VALID IDDC CODES                                                       
*                                                                               
%WWDC99                                                                         
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*****************************************************************               
*                                                               *               
* STEG 1  SORTERA PRISREGISTREET PER IDARTNR                    *               
*                                                               *               
*****************************************************************               
                                                                                
*    -- CHECKED BY WY2000                                                       
                                                                                
SORT W56067D1 TO TPFIL1 USING (IN61-IDARTNR)                                    
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*****************************************************************               
*                                                               *               
* STEG 2  SORTERA WDL6 PÅ IDARTNR                               *               
*                                                               *               
*****************************************************************               
                                                                                
SORT W56067D2 TO TPFIL2 USING (IN65-IDARTNR) BEFORE SORT-INIT                   
                                                                                
 SORT-INIT. PROC                                                                
  PERFORM WWBYT03                                                               
  IF BYT03-OBJEKT = 'N'                                                         
    SELECT                                                                      
  END-IF                                                                        
 END-PROC                                                                       
                                                                                
%WWBYT03 'IN65-'                                                                
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*****************************************************************               
*                                                               *               
* STEG 3  MATCHA TPFIL1 PRISREG, MED TPFIL2 WDL6 (INLEVHISTORIK)*               
*                                                               *               
*****************************************************************               
                                                                                
JOB INPUT(TPFIL1 KEY (T61-IDARTNR )                      +                      
          TPFIL2 KEY (T65-IDARTNR))                                             
                                                                                
IF MATCHED                                                                      
    W-IDARTNR   = T61-IDARTNR                                                   
    W-IDDC      = T65-IDDC                                                      
    PERFORM S75-TEST-DIST35                                                     
    IF T61-PRARTBTO-USD < 1      +                                              
      OR T65-IDDISTR = DIST35-US-US-TRANSFER                                    
      W-PRARTBTO ROUNDED = T65-PRARTBEL-PR                                      
      W-COST ROUNDED = W-PRARTBTO * T65-KVAKS                                   
      W-EXTENSION1 ROUNDED = W-PRARTBTO * T65-KVAKS                             
    ELSE                                                                        
      W-PRARTBTO ROUNDED = T61-PRARTBTO-USD                                     
      W-COST ROUNDED = W-PRARTBTO * T65-KVAKS                                   
      W-EXTENSION1 ROUNDED = W-PRARTBTO * T65-KVAKS                             
    END-IF                                                                      
    W-IDFAKT      = T65-IDFAKT                                                  
    W-DAFAKT      = T65-DAFAKT                                                  
    W-DAFAKT2     = W-DAFAKT                                                    
    W-UT-FIX-5    = W-DAFAKT-YYYY                                               
    W-UT-FIX-4    = '/'                                                         
    W-UT-FIX-3    = W-DAFAKT-MM                                                 
    W-UT-FIX-2    = '/'                                                         
    W-UT-FIX-1    = W-DAFAKT-DD                                                 
    W-KVAKS       = T65-KVAKS                                                   
    W-PRARTNTO ROUNDED   = T65-PRARTBEL-PR                                      
    W-END-COST ROUNDED   = W-PRARTNTO * T65-KVAKS                               
    W-EXTENSION2 ROUNDED = W-PRARTNTO * T65-KVAKS                               
     IF T65-IDDC = NDC-US-RU                                                    
       W-SUM-EXTENS1 = W-EXTENSION1                                             
       W-SUM-EXTENS2 = W-EXTENSION2                                             
       PRINT LISTA41                                                            
     ELSE-IF T65-IDDC = NDC-US-LA                                               
       W-SUM-EXTENS5 = W-EXTENSION1                                             
       W-SUM-EXTENS6 = W-EXTENSION2                                             
       PRINT LISTA43                                                            
     END-IF                                                                     
   PRINT LISTA2                                                                 
ELSE                                                                            
   IF TPFIL2                                                                    
      W-IDARTNR   = T65-IDARTNR                                                 
      W-IDDC      = T65-IDDC                                                    
      W-PRARTBTO ROUNDED = T65-PRARTBEL-PR                                      
      W-COST ROUNDED = W-PRARTBTO * T65-KVAKS                                   
      W-EXTENSION1 ROUNDED = W-PRARTBTO * T65-KVAKS                             
      W-IDFAKT      = T65-IDFAKT                                                
      W-DAFAKT      = T65-DAFAKT                                                
      W-DAFAKT2     = W-DAFAKT                                                  
      W-UT-FIX-5    = W-DAFAKT-YYYY                                             
      W-UT-FIX-4    = '/'                                                       
      W-UT-FIX-3    = W-DAFAKT-MM                                               
      W-UT-FIX-2    = '/'                                                       
      W-UT-FIX-1    = W-DAFAKT-DD                                               
      W-KVAKS       = T65-KVAKS                                                 
      W-PRARTNTO ROUNDED   = T65-PRARTBEL-PR                                    
      W-END-COST ROUNDED   = W-PRARTNTO * T65-KVAKS                             
      W-EXTENSION2 ROUNDED = W-PRARTNTO * T65-KVAKS                             
     IF T65-IDDC = NDC-US-RU                                                    
       W-SUM-EXTENS1 = W-EXTENSION1                                             
       W-SUM-EXTENS2 = W-EXTENSION2                                             
       PRINT LISTA41                                                            
     ELSE-IF T65-IDDC = NDC-US-LA                                               
       W-SUM-EXTENS5 = W-EXTENSION1                                             
       W-SUM-EXTENS6 = W-EXTENSION2                                             
       PRINT LISTA43                                                            
     END-IF                                                                     
   PRINT LISTA2                                                                 
   END-IF                                                                       
END-IF                                                                          
                                                                                
                                                                                
%WWDIST35   'T65-' PROC ''                                                      
                                                                                
  NEWPAGE                                                                       
                                                                                
  REPORT LISTA41                +                                               
         PRINTER W56067D3       +                                               
         LINESIZE 205           +                                               
         SPACE 0                +                                               
         NOHEADING              +                                               
         NOSPREAD               +                                               
         NOADJUST               +                                               
         PAGESIZE 32767         +                                               
         NODATE                                                                 
                                                                                
                                                                                
SEQUENCE W-IDFAKT  W-DAFAKT  W-IDARTNR                                          
                                                                                
CONTROL FINAL NOPRINT                                                           
                                                                                
SUM W-SUM-EXTENS1 W-SUM-EXTENS2                                                 
                                                                                
                                                                                
LINE  1  W-IDFAKT             +                                                 
         W-SEM                +                                                 
         W-UT-FIX             +                                                 
         W-SEM                +                                                 
         W-KVAKS              +                                                 
         W-SEM                +                                                 
         W-PRARTBTO           +                                                 
         W-SEM                +                                                 
         W-EXTENSION1         +                                                 
         W-SEM                +                                                 
         W-PRARTNTO           +                                                 
         W-SEM                +                                                 
         W-EXTENSION2         +                                                 
         W-SEM                +                                                 
         W-IDARTNR            +                                                 
         W-SEM                                                                  
                                                                                
  BEFORE-BREAK. PROC                                                            
         DISPLAY ' '                                                            
         DISPLAY W-SEM           +                                              
                 W-SEM           +                                              
                 W-SEM           +                                              
                 W-SEM           +                                              
                 W-SUM-EXTENS1   +                                              
                 W-SEM           +                                              
                 W-SEM           +                                              
                 W-SUM-EXTENS2   +                                              
                 W-SEM           +                                              
                 W-SEM                                                          
         DISPLAY ' '                                                            
  END-PROC                                                                      
                                                                                
BEFORE-LINE. PROC                                                               
 IF FIRST-LINE1 = 'J'                                                           
   DISPLAY '¤DAPW56067-041'                                                     
   DISPLAY '¤DAPW56067'                                                         
   DISPLAY 'INVOICE NUMBER;INVOICE DATE;DELIVERED QTY;'   +                     
           'LIFO-BASE;EXTENSION;INVOICE BASE;EXTENSION;PART NUMBER;'            
   FIRST-LINE1 = 'N'                                                            
 END-IF                                                                         
END-PROC                                                                        
                                                                                
  NEWPAGE                                                                       
                                                                                
  REPORT LISTA43                +                                               
         PRINTER W56067D5       +                                               
         LINESIZE 205           +                                               
         SPACE 0                +                                               
         NOHEADING              +                                               
         NOSPREAD               +                                               
         NOADJUST               +                                               
         PAGESIZE 32767         +                                               
         NODATE                                                                 
                                                                                
                                                                                
SEQUENCE W-IDFAKT  W-DAFAKT  W-IDARTNR                                          
                                                                                
CONTROL FINAL NOPRINT                                                           
                                                                                
                                                                                
SUM W-SUM-EXTENS5 W-SUM-EXTENS6                                                 
                                                                                
                                                                                
LINE  1  W-IDFAKT             +                                                 
         W-SEM                +                                                 
         W-UT-FIX             +                                                 
         W-SEM                +                                                 
         W-KVAKS              +                                                 
         W-SEM                +                                                 
         W-PRARTBTO           +                                                 
         W-SEM                +                                                 
         W-EXTENSION1         +                                                 
         W-SEM                +                                                 
         W-PRARTNTO           +                                                 
         W-SEM                +                                                 
         W-EXTENSION2         +                                                 
         W-SEM                +                                                 
         W-IDARTNR            +                                                 
         W-SEM                                                                  
                                                                                
  BEFORE-BREAK. PROC                                                            
         DISPLAY ' '                                                            
         DISPLAY W-SEM           +                                              
                 W-SEM           +                                              
                 W-SEM           +                                              
                 W-SEM           +                                              
                 W-SUM-EXTENS5   +                                              
                 W-SEM           +                                              
                 W-SEM           +                                              
                 W-SUM-EXTENS6   +                                              
                 W-SEM           +                                              
                 W-SEM                                                          
         DISPLAY ' '                                                            
  END-PROC                                                                      
                                                                                
BEFORE-LINE. PROC                                                               
 IF FIRST-LINE2 = 'J'                                                           
   DISPLAY '¤DAPW56067-043'                                                     
   DISPLAY '¤DAPW56067'                                                         
   DISPLAY 'INVOICE NUMBER;INVOICE DATE;DELIVERED QTY;'   +                     
           'LIFO-BASE;EXTENSION;INVOICE BASE;EXTENSION;PART NUMBER;'            
   FIRST-LINE2 = 'N'                                                            
 END-IF                                                                         
END-PROC                                                                        
                                                                                
  NEWPAGE                                                                       
                                                                                
  REPORT LISTA2                 +                                               
         PRINTER W56067D6       +                                               
         LINESIZE 205           +                                               
         SPACE 0                +                                               
         NOHEADING              +                                               
         NOSPREAD               +                                               
         NOADJUST               +                                               
         PAGESIZE 32767         +                                               
         NODATE +                                                               
         SUMCTL                 +                                               
         DTLCOPY                +                                               
         SUMMARY                                                                
                                                                                
SEQUENCE W-IDDC                                                                 
                                                                                
CONTROL W-IDDC                                                                  
                                                                                
                                                                                
LINE  1  W-IDDC               +                                                 
         W-SEM                +                                                 
         W-COST               +                                                 
         W-SEM                +                                                 
         W-END-COST           +                                                 
         W-SEM                                                                  
                                                                                
BEFORE-BREAK. PROC                                                              
 IF LEVEL = 2                                                                   
         DISPLAY W-SEM           +                                              
                 W-COST          +                                              
                 W-SEM           +                                              
                 W-END-COST      +                                              
                 W-SEM                                                          
 END-IF                                                                         
 IF FIRST-LINE3 = 'J'                                                           
   DISPLAY '¤DAPW56067-001'                                                     
   DISPLAY '¤DAPW56067'                                                         
   DISPLAY 'DISTRIBUTOR;JANUARY-1-COST;END-YEAR-COST;'                          
   FIRST-LINE3 = 'N'                                                            
 END-IF                                                                         
END-PROC                                                                        
